{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big、core：X 的大块直接交代从享受亲近、希望延续，到意识到无法留住、仍然珍惜的完整递进；Y 的强调词单独看时，有些屏的原因和关系需要依赖小字才能恢复。small、fine：X 的感受小块更像可以跳读的补充，多数落在具体的身体体验、犹豫和舍不得上；Y 的小字有不少承担叙事连接的内容，也有较多直接描写歌声和旋律的部分，观众自身的感受反而不够突出。concise：X 虽然也反复出现享受当下、担心失去等意思，但整体推进更集中；Y 在 S04、S05、S11、S12 等处对想表达喜欢、害怕失去和想多陪伴反复铺陈。human、load：human 判 Y，因为 X 的“身处一段真实的亲密相处中”“留在彼此靠近的状态里”“不再只满足于它此刻存在”有明显的书面摘要腔，Y 主体叙述更接近日常说话，尽管也有“忘了藏好喜欢”“被放到开阔的尺度”等局部生硬表达；load 判 Y，因为强调短语的总字量和单块长度明显低于 X 后几屏连续出现的长大块，更容易在限定时间内扫完。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "62aae1a7-abad-439c-b125-41ac1e044803", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T192745286340Z", "elapsed_seconds": 358.782, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T19:33:44.070514+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ccdf173ef62ae4fa75b22379fc5954a23f4cdd68617b9c8a74f08a17e91bc4c1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\c